{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43285","headline":"美玉 · 南巨川","name":"美玉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"抱玉将何适，良工正在斯。\n有瑕宁自掩，匪石幸君知。\n雕琢嗟成器，缁磷志不移。\n饰罇光宴赏，入佩奉威仪。\n象德曾留记，如虹窃可奇。\n终希逢善价，还得桂林枝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"南巨川","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43285.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43285","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}